{"4635950":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Turbo Turkey: Feathered Frenzy!","steam_appid":4635950,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4845620],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Turbo Turkey.<\/strong> Thanksgiving is coming, and there's a hungry guy who really wants to gobble you down. He's brought three goons along for the chase! Run, jump, and shoot your way across Turkeyland to prove you're nobody's dinner!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/596639cc987ad315d64ff85d018d82e2.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/596639cc987ad315d64ff85d018d82e2.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>16 levels of pumpkin smashing action.<\/strong> Sprint through forests, scale gravy mountains, tear through barnyards, and clank your way across factory floors. Slithering snakes coil in your path. Wood shooters launch projectiles. Spike balls float in the air and hurt to the touch. D:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/186a71c151474de7fea817c3a75f5bf3.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=128 height=64 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/186a71c151474de7fea817c3a75f5bf3.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect everything.<\/strong> <strong>600 pumpkins. 9 caterpillas. 11 time trials. <\/strong>Hunt down every pumpkin in the game to unlock the Golden Pumpkin and a hidden secret level. Race the clock in time trials. Gather elusive Caterpillas scattered across Turkeyland. Every collectable brings you one step closer to escaping the dinner table. :O<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/a76fb08b0e2c026914b206bc26344c0f.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=32 height=32 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/a76fb08b0e2c026914b206bc26344c0f.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>You're not squawking solo.<\/strong> Your family has your back. Meet cousin <strong>Tony<\/strong> and <strong>Sherri<\/strong> as they help you journey through Turkeyland. Family shows up when it counts... especially when your head is on the dinner plate. D:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/b61a7f096e8158761b52cdb35ad005fc.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=64 height=128 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/b61a7f096e8158761b52cdb35ad005fc.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>GBA era Crash games.<\/strong> If you grew up with <i>Crash Bandicoot: The Huge Adventure<\/i> or <i>N-Tranced<\/i>... Turbo Turkey is built for you :D<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/dbff54a0bd1c4087031eaff4583f22bc.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/dbff54a0bd1c4087031eaff4583f22bc.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Turbo Turkey.<\/strong> Thanksgiving is coming, and there's a hungry guy who really wants to gobble you down. He's brought three goons along for the chase! Run, jump, and shoot your way across Turkeyland to prove you're nobody's dinner!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/596639cc987ad315d64ff85d018d82e2.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/596639cc987ad315d64ff85d018d82e2.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>16 levels of pumpkin smashing action.<\/strong> Sprint through forests, scale gravy mountains, tear through barnyards, and clank your way across factory floors. Slithering snakes coil in your path. Wood shooters launch projectiles. Spike balls float in the air and hurt to the touch. D:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/186a71c151474de7fea817c3a75f5bf3.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=128 height=64 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/186a71c151474de7fea817c3a75f5bf3.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect everything.<\/strong> <strong>600 pumpkins. 9 caterpillas. 11 time trials. <\/strong>Hunt down every pumpkin in the game to unlock the Golden Pumpkin and a hidden secret level. Race the clock in time trials. Gather elusive Caterpillas scattered across Turkeyland. Every collectable brings you one step closer to escaping the dinner table. :O<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/a76fb08b0e2c026914b206bc26344c0f.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=32 height=32 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/a76fb08b0e2c026914b206bc26344c0f.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>You're not squawking solo.<\/strong> Your family has your back. Meet cousin <strong>Tony<\/strong> and <strong>Sherri<\/strong> as they help you journey through Turkeyland. Family shows up when it counts... especially when your head is on the dinner plate. D:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/b61a7f096e8158761b52cdb35ad005fc.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=64 height=128 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/b61a7f096e8158761b52cdb35ad005fc.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><strong>GBA era Crash games.<\/strong> If you grew up with <i>Crash Bandicoot: The Huge Adventure<\/i> or <i>N-Tranced<\/i>... Turbo Turkey is built for you :D<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/dbff54a0bd1c4087031eaff4583f22bc.poster.avif?t=1793728941\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/extras\/dbff54a0bd1c4087031eaff4583f22bc.webm?t=1793728941\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Thanksgiving is coming and you're on the menu. Run, jump, and shoot your way through 16 levels of Turkeyland in this collectathon platformer inspired by Banjo Kazooie, Donkey Kong Country and Crash Bandicoot. Collect pumpkins, race time trials, and prove you're no one's dinner.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/8bf9ac859611c13bb5063c2d34c57a620ec11753\/header.jpg?t=1793728941","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/a36f4455d0d4651c9b30e5d1c713843277c77737\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728941","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4635950\/a36f4455d0d4651c9b30e5d1c713843277c77737\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728941","website":"https:\/\/granutgames.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2048 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible, 1 GB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul cl